  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nReader mode allows loading of untrusted image, videos, etc in chrome-distiller://[GUID] origin. Further more, there seems to be weak sanitization of contents. For example, <button> tag can contain `onclick` attribute. But this will be blocked by default CSP set in Reader"
